 Rank←{
⍝ ⍺: index columns of the search terms :: integer vector
⍝ ⍵: (BM25F score matrix)(row indices) :: numeric matrix ⍴(≢documents)×(≢index), integer vector
⍝ ←: Rows of ⍵ containing at least one search term, descending BM25F (see CACHE.ComputeSearch)
     (BM25F rows)←⍵
     score←+/BM25F[rows;(⍺≤⊢/⍴BM25F)/⍺]   ⍝ Terms absent from the index score zero
     rows[order/⍨0<score[order←⍒score]]
 }
